{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.sale",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "那家杂货屋打半价了",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.sale",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyuki.sale",
    "idolId": "chiyuki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，那家杂货屋好像打半价。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哇！真的呢～！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，制作人先生的马克杯，再等等就好了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，那时候马上带我去挺好的。现在大概已经没了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "啊，那是……也许，真的呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，抱歉。千雪也想要来着吧。一起买下来就好了……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不、不会！抱歉，突然说这种话。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……碰头，我们赶紧去吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，是啊。走吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（呼……总觉得，就这么来了……）",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（马克杯，还在吗……）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——千雪！？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……制、制作人先生！您还在事务所吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，出来买晚饭……千雪才是，我以为你早回去了。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不是……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……是来看半价的？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是、是的。制作人先生也是……？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，不……其实是来看那只马克杯的。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "诶……！其实，我也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，是这样啊。因为千雪看起来特别喜欢。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我一直在想，会不会已经没有了。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "制作人先生……！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，如果还在的话我买吧……可以说，我买下来吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "给……我吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是这样没错……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哇……！当然。非常……高兴……！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "啊，神啊……愿马克杯还在，愿马克杯还在……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，千雪，在念咒吗？看来真的很喜欢啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，我也来祈祷。呃，愿马克杯还在……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，制作人先生……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "结果又回到事务所了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是啊。想快点用它喝咖啡♪",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……买到了就好。"
      }
    }
  },
